00:08:22.900 --> 00:08:28.500
Most coverage of visa refusals treats them as simple administrative outcomes. Yet the process

00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:33.780
involves layered checks that weigh national security data against individual circumstances and

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:40.300
diplomatic relations. When a government like Ghana requests judicial review of a Canadian denial for

00:08:40.300 --> 00:08:45.780
